@title 3D heat strip: airflow, shell, heat flow and devices on in a short window keep the panels in place
@area 3D
@sizes 1280x688 1366x768
# After the first result the strip holds the temperature bar. Turning on Airflow (a second bar), Shell, Heat flow and Devices adds their notes under the bars and wraps the controls. The toolbar and panels stay where they were: the strip keeps room for the notes row.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 60
shot 01-first-result
click_text Airflow
wait 10
click_text Shell
wait 10
click_text "Heat flow"
wait 10
click_text Devices
wait 20
shot 02-four-layers-on
check_layout
